                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24416: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Mexicali</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Boyle</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                        1920</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your July 31st.</p>
                <p>Department approves action taken regarding aviators’ border cards.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
